    "background_story": "Julia was a renowned pastry chef, celebrated for her delectable creations that showcased the art of carbohydrate manipulation. Growing up in a family of bakers, Julia was fascinated by the science behind yeast fermentation and the magic of transforming simple ingredients into intricate masterpieces. Her bakery, 'Sweet Delights,' quickly gained a loyal following for its mouthwatering croissants, crusty bread, and decadent cakes. Julia's passion for carbohydrates went beyond mere baking; she was dedicated to educating her customers about the importance of whole grains and the role of complex carbohydrates in a balanced diet. Her commitment to using only the finest, locally-sourced ingredients earned her a reputation as a master artisan, and her bakery became a beloved institution in the community.",
